  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the projection of the line segment joining the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,5</mo><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;on the plane <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> is equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;units, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mn>169</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "3925",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, point&nbsp;<math><mi>A</mi></math> be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3,5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />If <math><mi>θ</mi></math> is the angle between the normal vector to the plane and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></math> then, the length of the projection <math><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br />Normal vector <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math><br /><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>→</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>72</mn></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>66</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>91</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Length of the projection <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3925</mn></msqrt><mn>91</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>157</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>13</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;units"
  }
